      "content": "but that's just talk, isn't it? \"professional help\" and \"connection\"... how can i connect to people who don't even want to acknowledge i exist? it's not just a bad phase, it's like the social fabric just tore and i'm on the wrong side of it. everything i try to do just makes it worse. i feel like i'm just taking up space in a world that's already decided i don't belong. it feels more like an ending than a struggle.",
